# HR-F-06 paper is locked

The Leave Request print layout must stay identical to `EW - HR-F-06 Leave request.docx` on every PC.

Do **not** change shape, size, spacing, padding, row heights, or print layout unless the user explicitly asks.

Locked measurements:

- A4 `210mm × 297mm`, `@page { margin: 0 }`
- Sheet padding `20mm 16.26mm 25.4mm 17.51mm` (top right bottom left)
- Table width `174.6mm` (Word 9900 twips) — never `width: 100%` on print
- Logo `51.23mm × 25.31mm`, title 14pt, body 10pt Calibri
- Data rows `15pt`, section headings `18pt`, sig `24pt`, approvals `26pt`, HR comment `56pt`, HR foot `20pt`
- Start/end dates `31-Aug-26`, centered
- Print iframe / bake-values path; same CSS for one paper and many papers

The director e-signature image size is independent of the paper lock.

Filing completed papers into Annual leave / Bereavement / Lateness vacations / Marriage leave / Sick leave / Unpaid / Others is list-only. Do not change the paper for that feature.
